{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fruchtermanReingoldLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"iterations"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"optimalDistance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"threshold"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"barnesHutTheta"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"using"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RandomNumberGenerator","preciseIdentifier":"s:SG"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE25fruchtermanReingoldLayout10iterations15optimalDistance9threshold14barnesHutTheta6weight5usingAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGSi_SdSgSdAQSd5Edges_5IndexQZXEqd__ztSGRd__lF","title":"fruchtermanReingoldLayout(iterations:optimalDistance:threshold:barnesHutTheta:weight:using:)","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"GraphDrawing"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/FruchtermanReingoldLayout.swift#L42","fileName":"FruchtermanReingoldLayout.swift"}},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fruchtermanReingoldLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"iterations"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 50, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"optimalDistance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"threshold"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1e-4, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"barnesHutTheta"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { _ in 1 }, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"using"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"generator"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SG","text":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","text":"Drawing"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every pair of vertices repels with force k²\/d and every edge attracts its ends with force","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" · d²\/k, where d is their distance (at least 0.01) and k is ","type":"text"},{"code":"optimalDistance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(default √(1\/n)). Each step moves every vertex along its net force by at most the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"temperature, which starts at a tenth of the larger side of the start’s bounding box (k\/10","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when every vertex starts at one point) and falls by the same amount each step, reaching 0","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"code":"iterations + 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" steps. Two vertices at exactly the same point repel as if 0.01","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"apart, along a direction fixed by their two ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" offsets, so coincident vertices","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"separate deterministically. The run stops after ","type":"text"},{"code":"iterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" steps, or earlier once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moves’ root-sum-square divided by n is below ","type":"text"},{"code":"threshold","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Self-loops are ignored; parallel edges","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"add their weights. The drawing is in layout units (vertices end about k apart), not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rescaled. A directed graph is drawn through ","type":"text"},{"code":"undirectedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The start takes exactly 2n draws: x then y for each vertex in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, each the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"top 53 bits of one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":". The same generator state gives the same drawing. Positions are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not stable across library versions, because the iteration is chaotic and any change in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"summation order changes its digits."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Repulsion is exact by default: O(n²) per step, for graphs up to a few thousand vertices."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"barnesHutTheta: θ"},{"type":"text","text":" approximates it with a Barnes–Hut quadtree, O(n log n) per step: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"square cell of side s whose centre of mass is at distance D from the vertex, and which does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not contain the vertex, acts as one body when s\/D < θ. θ = 1.2 suits graphs past about 5,000 vertices;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"θ = 0 is exact repulsion."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Fruchterman and Reingold, “Graph drawing by force-directed placement”, Software: Practice","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and Experience 21(11), 1991.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Barnes and Hut, “A hierarchical O(N log N) force-calculation algorithm”, Nature 324,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"1986."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(iterations · (n² + m)) time exactly, O(iterations · (n log n + m)) with Barnes–Hut; O(n + m)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"memory."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iterations ≥ 0"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"optimalDistance"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is positive and finite;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"threshold ≥ 0"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"barnesHutTheta"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is finite and not negative; every weight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is finite and not negative."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/fruchtermanReingoldLayout(iterations:optimalDistance:threshold:barnesHutTheta:weight:using:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/fruchtermanreingoldlayout(iterations:optimaldistance:threshold:barneshuttheta:weight:using:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A force-directed drawing by Fruchterman and Reingold’s spring embedder, from positions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drawn uniformly in [0, 1)² from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generator"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"references":{"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Graph","kind":"identifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Graph","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Graph"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","title":"GraphDrawing","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing","role":"collection"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph/fruchtermanReingoldLayout(iterations:optimalDistance:threshold:barnesHutTheta:weight:using:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fruchtermanReingoldLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"iterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"optimalDistance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double